Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.28,0:00:05.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you say the death lament Stratum?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.96,0:00:10.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, we're planning on\Naccepting a request to go there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.44,0:00:12.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys feel like tagging along?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.62,0:00:16.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that Stratum filled with creepy\Nstuff like corpse and skeleton fiends?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.60,0:00:18.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're making it sound like\Nyou're going on vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.02,0:00:21.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you really going to a place like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.58,0:00:23.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we'll be leaving soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.40,0:00:24.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you busy?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.32,0:00:27.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, no, that's not the issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.52,0:00:31.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that I think about it, you were\Nnever good with spooky stuff, Lamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.62,0:00:34.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it too scary for you?\NWhat? Obviously not!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.68,0:00:36.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only a child would\Nstill be afraid of that!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.86,0:00:37.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.36,0:00:40.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, you don't like scary things, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.70,0:00:44.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just a bunch of moving\Nskeletons, corpses, and ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.46,0:00:46.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not like there's anything really bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.46,0:00:47.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no need to fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.06,0:00:51.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain, it's perfectly normal\Nto be scared of those things.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.36,0:00:56.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't seriously expect everybody you\Nmeet to be as stupidly fearless as you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.66,0:00:59.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything I've heard about that place has
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.68,0:01:02.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,been second hand information\Ncould you tell me a
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.40,0:01:04.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,little bit more about\Nthe dead's lament stratum
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.48,0:01:07.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what do you want to\Nknow the sky overhead is
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.54,0:01:09.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,covered in thick stormy\Nclouds with constant
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.92,0:01:12.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,flashes of lightning\Nbecause of that it always
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.34,0:01:14.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,feels chilly and there\Nare these crumbling and
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.36,0:01:17.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,decrepit gravestones\Nscattered all over the place
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.92,0:01:21.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't know llamas had this much\Ntrouble dealing with scary things
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.17,0:01:54.51,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,title,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(773,1)\an8\fs20}Reborn as a Vending Machine, {\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.28,0:02:07.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.86,0:02:35.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:53.06,0:02:57.94,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(112,55)\fad(734,1)\fscx76}The Dead's Lament Stratum
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.02,0:03:01.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Lamas, you're not actually\Nscared of that kind of stuff, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.76,0:03:02.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.67,0:03:03.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, uh, of course I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.00,0:03:05.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, guys, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.54,0:03:06.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I ain't afraid of no ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.74,0:03:07.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's news to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.10,0:03:11.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember how you used to be\Nwhen you heard a scary story.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.46,0:03:13.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't even go to\Nthe bathroom by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.02,0:03:14.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You, Hulemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.28,0:03:16.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugh, don't bring that up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.10,0:03:18.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's ancient history. Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.04,0:03:21.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're not going to force Lamas to\Ncome with us if she doesn't want to,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.98,0:03:24.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so the question is, who's\Ngoing to carry Boxo?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.38,0:03:28.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody in our group has that kind of\Nstrength. What to do? Let's see here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.30,0:03:31.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were counting on\Nbeing able to bring Boxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.98,0:03:36.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he's not accompanying us, a\Nlong-term campaign will be hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.48,0:03:40.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I doubt the Stratum Lord there is\Ngoing to just stay in one place.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.28,0:03:42.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The search for it won't\Nbe a simple matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.48,0:03:45.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.39,0:03:46.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on! Don't count me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.72,0:03:49.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never actually said\NI wouldn't go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.38,0:03:50.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be fine, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.20,0:03:53.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can totally handle scary stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.72,0:03:54.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.08,0:03:58.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should have no problem going\Nto the Dead's Lament Stratum then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.50,0:03:59.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.10,0:04:01.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great, I'm happy to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.22,0:04:05.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, we'll head in first.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.40,0:04:09.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As soon as we get everything\Nsorted, we'll be right behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.54,0:04:11.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Phil Mina's not coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.14,0:04:13.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, she decided to sit this one out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.50,0:04:16.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The vice captain gets\Nfrightened pretty easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.08,0:04:17.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, yep.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:17.48,0:04:19.98,sign_6174_55_ho_ho_ho_ho,text,0,0,0,,ho ho ho ho
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.06,0:04:21.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Must be nice for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.40,0:04:35.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.24,0:04:38.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This will be our home base for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.44,0:04:41.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're saying we're going to\Nmake a camp in a place like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.70,0:04:42.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's such a chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.88,0:04:44.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's practically clucking.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.14,0:04:47.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you can't handle it\Nanymore, just say the word.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.56,0:04:50.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll turn around and go back\Nto the Clearflow Lake stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.96,0:04:53.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hope you were ridiculous, I'm fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.42,0:04:55.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to worry one bit!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.74,0:04:57.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright then, let's check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.24,0:05:09.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, there you are. Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.62,0:05:11.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been awaiting your arrival.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.12,0:05:16.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.52,0:05:21.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I figured she was lying, but this\Nis even worse than I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.76,0:05:23.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe it or not, she's handled it well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.98,0:05:24.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.18,0:05:29.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Carrying her to her room won't be a\Nproblem, but what do we do about Boxo?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.98,0:05:35.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, nice one, Boxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.40,0:05:39.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Madam, do you mind if we get\NBoxo set up in front of the inn?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.54,0:05:41.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.58,0:05:43.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This must be the magic item with a mind of
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.98,0:05:46.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,its own that I've heard\Nso much about recently,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.54,0:05:47.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.02,0:05:49.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How mysterious.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.46,0:05:53.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.40,0:05:56.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So much has changed, but Lamas\Nis still the same as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.48,0:05:59.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As soon as you began telling\Na scary story just like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.70,0:06:02.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she'd cover her ears and\Nstart screaming bloody murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.50,0:06:03.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It takes me right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.88,0:06:08.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hulemy likes to tease Lamas, but\Nit's obvious they're very close.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.20,0:06:11.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They almost seem more like sisters.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.70,0:06:14.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Normally, she would have\Nrun back home by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.24,0:06:16.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess she can't bear to leave this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.16,0:06:19.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope she's not forcing\Nherself to stay because
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.48,0:06:22.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she's afraid that there'd\Nbe nobody left to carry me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.30,0:06:23.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.64,0:06:26.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,something tells me you're\Nmisinterpreting the situation,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.36,0:06:30.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I might as well tell you the\Ntruth why Lamas is being so stubborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.62,0:06:34.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, it might hurt her\Nfeelings if I do. Too bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.68,0:06:38.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I bet you'll figure\Nit out if you think it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.78,0:06:42.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.69,0:06:43.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.98,0:06:59.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.89,0:07:00.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.06,0:07:03.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those are flame skulls.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.34,0:07:09.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But for some reason, they're\Njust wandering around.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.30,0:07:10.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are they doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.86,0:07:17.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is kind of like one\Nof those haunted houses.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.44,0:07:20.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll play it safe and put up a barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.54,0:07:26.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This might be a good chance to see if\Nany anti-undead remedies actually work.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.86,0:07:28.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, salt is the old standard.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:30.42,0:07:32.80,sign_2664_34_Megumi_Natural_W,text,0,0,0,,{\fs30\c&H5A401A&\3c&HDDD180&}Natural Rock Salt
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.88,0:07:32.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rock salt should do the trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.46,0:07:38.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.72,0:07:41.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't trust the old tails, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.32,0:07:43.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe this will work.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.80,0:07:49.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is supposed to be good\Nfor dealing with spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.86,0:07:51.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.88,0:07:54.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.14,0:07:57.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really thought that would work.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.32,0:07:59.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could it be I need more of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.14,0:08:03.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Morning, Boxxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.58,0:08:05.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you get any sleep last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.62,0:08:07.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did this come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.80,0:08:10.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I tried all sorts of things,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.92,0:08:14.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but none of them had any effect\Non these otherworldly monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.02,0:08:18.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As soon as Shui and the others arrived,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.98,0:08:22.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain Kerioyl immediately sent\Nthem out again to survey the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.86,0:08:26.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The captain mentioned something about\Ngathering allies to help tackle the stratum,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.86,0:08:28.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and then went off on his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.30,0:08:34.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Mr. Boxxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.96,0:08:40.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you weren't too surprised\Nby last night's spectacle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.72,0:08:42.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When did she get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.18,0:08:43.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She came out of nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.46,0:08:46.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In this place, whenever night falls,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.32,0:08:50.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,monsters tend to gather, even\Nin the middle of the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.60,0:08:55.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only those who are confident venture out\Nat night, but not all of them make it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.36,0:08:58.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I kind of wish you had\Ntold me that ahead of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.52,0:09:02.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, the monsters in\Nthis stratum envy the living.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.54,0:09:05.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, that means\Nyou're safe from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.48,0:09:07.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I sincerely doubt they'd attack you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.06,0:09:10.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's why they pretty\Nmuch left me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.74,0:09:13.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were just trying to\Nlook into the buildings.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.88,0:09:17.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're more akin to them, not being alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.94,0:09:18.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Marvelous.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.40,0:09:21.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean any offense by that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.52,0:09:23.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.43,0:09:26.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm basically a vending machine being\Npossessed by the soul of a human,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.44,0:09:28.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're not exactly wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.62,0:09:32.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That said, I'm not so sure that I'm\Nmore akin to a ghost than you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.42,0:09:38.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry about yesterday, Boxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.56,0:09:40.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my fault. Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.50,0:09:50.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how much longer\NI can keep this up. Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.32,0:09:52.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.23,0:09:54.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is going really bad. Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.08,0:09:56.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's in negative mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.44,0:09:58.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and taking my canned responses literally.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.76,0:10:00.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.67,0:10:02.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, this isn't like you, Lamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.58,0:10:05.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If something's holding you\Nback, then just overcome it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.58,0:10:06.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's what you always do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.26,0:10:08.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why didn't I think of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.94,0:10:12.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, all I have to do is\Nget used to it. Well said.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.96,0:10:16.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, I'm gonna give you a crash\Ncourse in beating your fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.32,0:10:17.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Crash course?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.78,0:10:21.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, I mean, thank you, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.20,0:10:25.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For your first lesson, I'd like you to\Ntake a leisurely stroll around the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.28,0:10:26.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, by myself?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.08,0:10:29.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nope, no way, lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.50,0:10:31.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gave in too quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.50,0:10:35.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get that it's a little gloomy over\Nthere, but it's daytime, so you'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.90,0:10:38.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You say that, but the mood\Nis different around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.38,0:10:40.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the Clear Flow Lake\NStratum is a frog fiend,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.94,0:10:43.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this place is like a king frog fiend.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.36,0:10:46.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That made no sense, but I kind\Nof get what she's trying to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.76,0:10:47.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since you're giving up,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.86,0:10:50.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,does that mean you're going back\Nto the Clear Flow Lake Stratum?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.44,0:10:51.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.52,0:10:53.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then all you can do is\Ntough it out, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.62,0:10:55.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess you have a point there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.92,0:11:00.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, there's a general store\Nnear the village entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.26,0:11:02.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to get some\Nrestorative potions.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.46,0:11:04.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, fine, I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.46,0:11:05.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Voxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.90,0:11:07.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's try to make this quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.76,0:11:10.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are going alone. Very funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.34,0:11:11.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.06,0:11:16.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No problem, just you watch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.38,0:11:18.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll show you I'm not a kid anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.24,0:11:19.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This will be a piece of cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.72,0:11:22.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.64,0:11:24.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing to be afraid of.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.36,0:11:25.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't falter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.84,0:11:27.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This must be how a parent\Nfeels when they watch
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.06,0:11:31.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,their child go out on their\Nown for the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.80,0:11:35.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.92,0:11:41.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, there, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.02,0:11:43.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a good try.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.38,0:11:46.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me a second and I'll heat\Nup some corn soup for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.42,0:11:48.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or maybe something sweet would be better.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.26,0:11:50.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't coddle the girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.26,0:11:52.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Lamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.38,0:11:53.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish I could help.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.70,0:11:59.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, when I think about\Nit, my job is to carry Boxo,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.88,0:12:02.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so this training is useless\Nif I don't have him with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.58,0:12:03.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.90,0:12:06.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it helps, you can bring him along.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.38,0:12:07.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.29,0:12:09.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as Boxo's with\Nme, I'm good! I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.00,0:12:11.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In spooky situations,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.24,0:12:14.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's way easier to handle it when\Nyou've got somebody else by your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.34,0:12:18.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm a vending machine, so, uh,\NI'm not sure if this even counts.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.72,0:12:22.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxo, are you still there?\NSay something! Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.60,0:12:24.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.51,0:12:26.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep talking to me, okay? Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.06,0:12:28.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you better not fall off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.64,0:12:31.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way I could do\Nthis without you by my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.50,0:12:34.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's almost like she's a kid\Nlearning how to ride a bike.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.80,0:12:36.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.06,0:12:39.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear, I'll do better.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.00,0:12:41.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't leave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.04,0:12:44.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want us to keep on exploring together.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.42,0:12:47.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.02,0:12:50.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lamas is desperately\Ntrying to overcome her
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.18,0:12:52.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fear so she and I can\Nstay with each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.00,0:12:55.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that case, I'll help her any way I can.
