Dialogue: 1,0:12:56.08,0:12:58.54,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text (bottom line),0,0,0,,{\an4\fs15\frz-14\pos(350,240)\t(1278,1279,\3c&HF8F3F2&\c&H000100&)}Aroma Diffuser
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.58,0:13:01.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This device disperses\Nscents around the vending
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.08,0:13:03.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,machine in order to draw a customer's end.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.30,0:13:05.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go ahead and try out a coffee aroma.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.46,0:13:09.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.02,0:13:11.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something smells good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.08,0:13:13.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now for step two.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.58,0:13:19.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.70,0:13:23.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This music is making me feel\Na whole lot calmer. Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.30,0:13:24.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like it's working.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.98,0:13:27.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if I'm doing too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.90,0:13:31.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.18,0:13:33.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check it out, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.48,0:13:35.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got this down pat now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.46,0:13:38.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not afraid anymore.\NGood job. Nice one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.98,0:13:40.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew you could do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.54,0:13:41.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.45,0:13:43.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it's time for you\Nto move on to step two.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.36,0:13:45.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what it is, I can handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.94,0:13:47.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look who's a pro now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.34,0:13:50.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you won't mind setting down\NBoxo and going around again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.64,0:13:51.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.55,0:13:52.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to have to decline.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.82,0:13:54.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She didn't even think twice about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.94,0:13:57.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her resolve is impressive in a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.72,0:13:59.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, there you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.50,0:14:02.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've come back with some hunters\Nto help with the campaign.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.80,0:14:04.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The band of gluttons, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.54,0:14:05.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.74,0:14:07.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Mishuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.10,0:14:09.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.52,0:14:11.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks so much for having us. Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.32,0:14:15.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He actually reached out\Nto the Menagerie of Fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.34,0:14:17.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be good to have\Nanother strong fighter,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.46,0:14:21.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I wonder if he'll be able to\Nhandle being in a group this big.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.38,0:14:24.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lichuel mentioned that he\Nwent on an adventure with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.16,0:14:26.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We asked him to join\Nthe Menagerie of Fools,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.26,0:14:28.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but he wanted to have\Na trial period first.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.34,0:14:32.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This campaign will help him decide if\Nhe wants to sign on for real, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.12,0:14:35.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd love to join, but I wanted\Nto make sure we'd be a good fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.54,0:14:38.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd hate to accept and\Nbecome a burden on everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.34,0:14:40.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see if I can handle teamwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.12,0:14:43.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sounds like he's just\Nbeing modest, But knowing him,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.30,0:14:46.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that is something to be\Nlegitimately concerned about.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.56,0:14:47.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, to summarize,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.70,0:14:50.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,our primary objective\Nin coming to the Dead's
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.34,0:14:53.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lament Stratum is to\Nlocate the Stratum Lord,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.24,0:14:54.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the King of Souls,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.42,0:14:55.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and take him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.66,0:14:59.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This won't be an easy job, but I'm\Nsure you can handle it no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.16,0:15:01.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't really get it myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.56,0:15:03.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I hear humans have\Nlots of trouble dealing
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.56,0:15:05.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with dark places and\Nstuff like corpse fiends.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.86,0:15:06.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.77,0:15:07.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.88,0:15:08.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't blame them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.02,0:15:10.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate corpse fiends too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.40,0:15:11.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They smell like rotten meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.02,0:15:14.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, one whiff and say\Ngoodbye to your appetite.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.96,0:15:16.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never thought about it before,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.66,0:15:19.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but humans and beast people\Nsee horror differently.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.80,0:15:22.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make sure you come back to\Nthe inn before nightfall.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.68,0:15:24.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone, prepare to move out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.98,0:15:25.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.24,0:15:28.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lamas, what was that\Ncrunching sound just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.26,0:15:36.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't get why they put their\Ngraves outside the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.34,0:15:38.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who knows why humans do anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.12,0:15:38.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.52,0:15:41.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mikenne, in short, don't know\Nwhat they're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.02,0:15:43.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's for the heck of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.48,0:15:44.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.39,0:15:47.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but if you left an offering on a\Ngravestone, monsters would just eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.96,0:15:48.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.82,0:15:50.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.90,0:15:54.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was afraid this would happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.34,0:16:01.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're all around us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.58,0:16:02.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You ready, Shiro?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.72,0:16:04.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was born ready, Aka.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.84,0:16:07.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just give us the word, Captain. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.42,0:16:16.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.64,0:16:17.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at them go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.00,0:16:19.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're destroying them!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.22,0:16:24.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that I've been here\Nfor a couple of days,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.54,0:16:29.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get the sense that the monsters are looking\Ninto the windows with a sense of envy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.18,0:16:31.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've heard rumors that,\Nunlike typical monsters,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.98,0:16:34.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the ones in this stratum\Nare made from dead humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.94,0:16:36.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's really true.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.70,0:16:39.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did you come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.36,0:16:40.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please insert coins.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.28,0:16:42.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.58,0:16:46.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even in moments like this, I can\Nstill only use my canned phrases?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.94,0:16:52.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think he means me any harm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.48,0:16:56.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'm being honest, this kid\Nlooks more curious than malicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.18,0:16:58.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would feel wrong to be mean to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.32,0:16:59.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.68,0:17:01.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.74,0:17:03.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, uh, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.44,0:17:04.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, cut it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.86,0:17:07.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, kid, don't grab at me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.14,0:17:09.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, if you stop doing that,\NI'll give you one of these.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.70,0:17:10.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sound good?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.78,0:17:19.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, drink up. Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.44,0:17:40.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, well, looks like it's another\Nbusy night for the loitering monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.32,0:17:44.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that the same kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.20,0:17:46.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that case.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.44,0:17:55.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder why he came back to me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.10,0:17:57.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does he like me or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.42,0:18:00.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's probably just a\Nkid expecting a treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.44,0:18:03.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Night after night, he came by.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.64,0:18:05.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never expected to say this,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.64,0:18:09.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I actually started to look forward\Nto our late-night interactions.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.24,0:18:12.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things have been going well,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.74,0:18:16.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so this is the first time we've\Ndecided to camp outside the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.64,0:18:21.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I can't give that corpse\Nfiend child any orange juice today.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.14,0:18:26.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we're going back tomorrow,\Nso he's only going to miss a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.96,0:18:28.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A corpse fiend.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.06,0:18:32.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's just one, but it looks\Nlike it's headed this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.50,0:18:35.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aka, what should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.16,0:18:38.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it's alone, we can take it out, Shiro.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.06,0:18:39.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.97,0:18:41.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do my part, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.00,0:18:49.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that him? A child, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.02,0:18:51.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel bad, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.34,0:18:53.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rest in peace, kid! You best!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.96,0:19:02.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong, Boxo?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.82,0:19:04.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with all the shouting?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.20,0:19:06.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That corpse fiend he killed. No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.76,0:19:08.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could it be the same one?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.74,0:19:09.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.20,0:19:12.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't this a label from\None of your drinks?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.40,0:19:14.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would a monster carry this around?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.54,0:19:17.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know I shouldn't blame\NAka for what he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.38,0:19:18.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not his fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.80,0:19:22.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I feel like I'm about to short out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.06,0:19:24.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He dropped a copper coin.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.96,0:19:27.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me he was\Ntrying to buy something.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.34,0:19:29.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way that's possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.32,0:19:31.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know if it was\Nthe same corpse fiend,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.74,0:19:34.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but there was one that was\Nwatching us from a distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.78,0:19:37.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It didn't try anything,\Nso I just ignored it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.94,0:19:39.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, I see now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.64,0:19:44.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was going to try to put that coin in\Nme because he saw others buying items.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.10,0:19:47.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.94,0:19:50.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Children don't need to\Nworry about stuff like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.60,0:19:53.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, all he had was\Na single copper coin.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.66,0:19:55.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not enough to buy anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.38,0:19:57.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please insert coins.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.90,0:20:03.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want the usual, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.26,0:20:09.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good job!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.48,0:20:10.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You all did well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.96,0:20:14.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We now have an idea of where\Nthe King of Souls is hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.54,0:20:15.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what's our next move?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.06,0:20:18.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you've thought of\Nsome way to deal with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.30,0:20:19.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.21,0:20:21.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I actually wanted to compare\Nnotes with you first.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.80,0:20:24.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know what kind of\Nmonster the King of Souls is?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.38,0:20:28.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not sure, but according to the rumors,\Nhe's some sort of powerful magic user.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.26,0:20:30.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I've heard that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.00,0:20:35.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got a ton of magic power and uses\Nlots of different elemental spells.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.10,0:20:36.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not a great combination for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.04,0:20:39.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got any thoughts on how\Nto deal with his magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.42,0:20:40.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.64,0:20:45.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't we have somebody in our party with\Nthe ability to block any kind of attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.08,0:20:47.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, you're not talking\Nabout Boxo, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.86,0:20:49.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ding, ding, you got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.48,0:20:53.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His barrier can block pretty much anything\Nyou throw at it, including magic spells.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.82,0:20:56.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you rush in with Boxo, you\Ndon't even have to take him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.88,0:21:00.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just keeping the King of Souls\Ndistracted is good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.40,0:21:02.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, so that's how it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.76,0:21:06.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm guessing this is the real reason he\Nwas so insistent on bringing me along.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.82,0:21:07.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.88,0:21:11.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember that he was able to block\Nspells back in the Labyrinth Stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.92,0:21:12.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.04,0:21:16.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll come up with a new plan from\Nscratch if you're not confident.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.60,0:21:18.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your call. Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.76,0:21:21.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew I could count on\Nyou, my Boxxo friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.18,0:21:22.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the man.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.24,0:21:24.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as he's okay with\Nit, I'm on board too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.88,0:21:25.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That settles it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.50,0:21:27.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As his name suggests,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.68,0:21:31.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the King of Souls has a number of other\Nmonsters serving as his bodyguards.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.60,0:21:33.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can ignore the small fry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.38,0:21:34.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll take care of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.52,0:21:35.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.43,0:21:38.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't get too worked up\Nnow, Lamas. Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.52,0:21:42.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone here has come together\Nto work towards the same goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.10,0:21:43.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've agreed on a plan,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.24,0:21:46.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and so the rest depends on what\Nhappens when we face our foe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.24,0:21:48.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For now, let's drink to lift our spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.14,0:21:50.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Box up!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.76,0:21:55.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.08,0:21:56.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.60,0:21:59.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once we finish up with this quest,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.66,0:22:02.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't mind having\Nanother toast with everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.08,0:22:28.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you can see that the\Nsmile is waiting for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.52,0:22:32.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's impossible to see,\Nbut it's a special day!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.04,0:22:35.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would like to be a good day.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.56,0:22:38.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to make a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.18,0:22:40.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to make a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.08,0:22:41.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to see the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.82,0:22:46.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know who knows,\Nbut it's not the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.24,0:22:50.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be happy with this moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.28,0:22:52.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today's day is a good day.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.46,0:22:53.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.96,0:23:00.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:35.01,0:23:40.01,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,upper left text,0,0,0,,{\pos(51,65)\fs14}Next Time
Dialogue: 1,0:23:35.01,0:23:40.01,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,lower right text,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs29\pos(183,298)\fscx87}What Can Be Done as a Vending Machine

